        "key": "q-shared-index-isolation",
        "question": "How does the shared retrieval index enforce workspace-level isolation beyond relevance-based retrieval, if at all?",
        "rationale": "The documentation says that all workspaces share a single retrieval index and that relevance alone selects passages for the prompt (evd-002), but it does not describe any workspace-based scoping or filtering. The answer affects the risk of one workspace retrieving content derived from another workspace's support history.",
